# Template for the Python trace tests. Copy to .env.test and fill in.
#   cp .env.test.example .env.test
# tests/conftest.py loads .env.test when present; in CI, set these in the
# environment instead and ship no file.

# Reading traces back out of Okahu, and running evals.
OKAHU_API_KEY=
OKAHU_API_ENDPOINT=
OKAHU_EVALUATION_ENDPOINT=

# Where the test run's own result traces are sent (see MONOCLE_EXPORTER below).
OKAHU_INGESTION_ENDPOINT=

# Exporters for the traces the test run itself emits: "file" writes them to
# ./.monocle/test_traces/, "okahu" POSTs them to OKAHU_INGESTION_ENDPOINT.
MONOCLE_EXPORTER=file,okahu

# Workflow name for those test-result traces. This is NOT how a test selects the
# trace it asserts on — that is the workflow_name= argument to with_trace_source().
MONOCLE_TEST_WORKFLOW_NAME=adk-travel-agent-typescript
